## Step 7: Deployment Considerations

### 7.1 Security
- Never expose Browserbase API keys in frontend code
- Use environment variables for all sensitive data
- Implement proper authentication for your API endpoints

### 7.2 Rate Limits
- Monitor your Browserbase usage
- Implement proper session cleanup
- Consider session pooling for high-volume applications

### 7.3 Error Recovery
- Implement retry logic for failed sessions
- Add proper logging for debugging
- Monitor session health and automatically recreate if needed

